  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "室內設計實習",
    "sub_ename": "INTERIOR DESIGN INTERNSHIP",
    "describe_ch": "藉由此實習課程的參加，使同學實際了解室內設計事務所之營運，進而熟悉了解室內設計實際的方法及應用技術。實習課程規定：1.本室內設計實習課程，每年將開設於室內設計組4年級上學期必修課程，為4學分之課程。學生須於4年級上學期時選修該門課程。2.實習總成績80﹪為實習機構之評比分數，20﹪為實習報告分數。3.一經查核符合實習期滿者，則給予該門課程學分。本課程為4學分之專業必修課程，學生應於與室內設計專業領域相關之機關、團體、公司或事務所實際參予實務工作320小時，並經負責人或主管人員簽證評比後取得本課程之學分。",
    "describe_eh": "Furthermore, students can understand the real method and the application technology of the architectural design. Course Registration: 1.\"Practice of interior design Studio\" is a required course with four credits for the program of interior design in the first semester of the fourth year. Course registration should be completed by the student in the first semester of the fourth year. 2.80% of the total score for internship comes from evaluations by the institutions and the other 20% is based on the internship reports. 3.Credit shall be granted after the accomplishment of internship practice is approved. This required course carrying four credits postulates that our students join the practical operation in any governmental or private institution, group, corporation, or firm with professions relevant to ours for 320 hours and obtain certification with supervisor's signature before acquiring this unit.\r\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 4.0
  },
